{"type":"text","timestamp":1788166877924,"sessionID":"ses_fa923204fffeJOVYIIzNA2JDJK","part":{"id":"prt_0570d214d001gOMN6n1yjNxbN1","messageID":"msg_0570b3dc9001XOWxRMG1viEZMe","sessionID":"ses_fa923204fffeJOVYIIzNA2JDJK","type":"text","text":"\n\nThe verifier (fact-checker) found **significant** issues — most critically, it claims `update_account` (account.py:68-69) has **no `@login_required`**, which would make the mass-assignment finding (#8) *unauthenticated* (CRITICAL, not HIGH). It also flags a misquoted snippet (`filtered_values` vs `form.data`), wrong line numbers, and CWE corrections. I must verify the `@login_required` claim by re-reading the full `account.py` — this materially changes a finding's severity.\n\n","time":{"start":1788166873422,"end":1788166877922}}}
